s\n    - flags\n    ", "parameters": {"type": "object", "properties": {"category": {"title": "Category", "type": "string"}}, "required": ["category"]}}}, {"type": "function", "function": {"name": "emoji-hub-server-get_emojis_by_group_tool", "description": "\n    Get all emojis from a specific group.\n\n    Some available groups include:\n    - face-positive, face-negative, face-neutral\n    - animal-bird, animal-mammal, animal-marine\n    - food-fruit, food-vegetable, food-sweet\n    - travel-and-places\n    - activities, objects, symbols, flags\n    ", "parameters": {"type": "object", "properties": {"group": {"title": "Group", "type": "string"}}, "required": ["group"]}}}]<|im_end|>"}, {"role": "user", "content": "I'm creating a birthday card design and need to incorporate food-themed emojis. First, I want to see all the general food and drink options available, then narrow it down to specifically fruit-related emojis, and finally get a random fruit emoji that I can use as a surprise element for the final design. How can I get this complete set of emojis with that final random selection?"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "I'll help you get that complete set of food-themed emojis for your birthday card design! Let me start by getting all the food and drink emojis, then the fruit-specific ones, and finally a random fruit emoji as your surprise element."}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "", "function_call": {"name": "emoji-hub-server-get_emojis_by_category_tool", "arguments": "{"category": "food-and-drink"}"}}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "", "function_call": {"name": "emoji-hub-server-get_emojis_by_group_tool", "arguments": "{"group": "food-fruit"}"}}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "", "function_call": {"name": "emoji-hub-server-get_random_emoji_by_group_tool", "arguments": "{"group": "food-fruit"}"}}, {"role": "function", "content": "{
